(text "Corrected from the 2007 printout: the two discrete LEDs (PB2, PB3) are now\nanode to the 220 ohm / Vcc side and cathode to the PB pin, like the LED bar.\nThe printout had them reversed, so they could never light; skeet.asm drives\nboth active-low (PB low = on)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 43.18 163.83 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "87bce605-082b-4a59-9b2c-3c2d6cc5f71d"))
